## Summary Cheat Sheet

| Integrity Type | SQL Tool | MongoDB Tool |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **No Duplicates** | `PRIMARY KEY`, `UNIQUE` | `_id`, Unique Indexes |
| **No Orphans** | `FOREIGN KEY` | Application-level checks |
| **Valid Data Types** | `INT`, `VARCHAR`, `DATE` | Schema Validation (optional) |
| **Business Rules** | `CHECK` constraints | Application logic |

